PRACTICAL – 5
Title:

Reverse Engineering of Android Application using APK Tool, Hex Dump and Dex Dump

Aim:

To perform reverse engineering of an Android application using APK Tool, Hex Dump, and Dex Dump.

Objectives:
To understand reverse engineering of Android applications
To decompile APK files using APK Tool
To analyze binary content using Hex Dump
To examine Dalvik bytecode using Dex Dump
To study application structure and source components
Procedure:
(i) Install Required Tools

Open terminal and run:

sudo apt update
sudo apt install apktool dexdump xxd -y

Verify installation:

apktool --version
(ii) Obtain APK File

Download or place the APK file (DivaApplication.apk) in the working directory.

(iii) Decompile APK using APK Tool
apktool d DivaApplication.apk

👉 Decompiled files will be stored in a folder.

(iv) Analyze Decompiled Files

Navigate into extracted folder:

cd DivaApplication

Observe:

AndroidManifest.xml
res directory
smali files
(v) Perform Hex Dump Analysis
xxd DivaApplication.apk | head

👉 Displays hexadecimal representation of APK contents.

(vi) Extract Dex File Information
dexdump DivaApplication.apk | less

OR

dexdump classes.dex | less

👉 Displays Dalvik bytecode and class information.

(vii) Analyze Application Components

Observe:

Package name
Activities
Permissions
Strings and methods
Smali code structure
Observation:
APK Tool successfully decompiled the APK file
AndroidManifest.xml and resource files were extracted
Hex dump displayed binary content of the APK
Dex Dump revealed Dalvik bytecode and class details
Application structure and components were analyzed successfully
Result:

Reverse engineering of the Android application was successfully performed using APK Tool, Hex Dump, and Dex Dump. The APK structure, manifest, resources, and bytecode were analyzed effectively.

Viva Questions:
Q: What is APK Tool used for?

👉 Used to decompile and rebuild Android APK files.

Q: What is reverse engineering?

👉 Process of analyzing software to understand its internal structure and behavior.

Q: What is Hex Dump?

👉 Hexadecimal representation of binary file contents.

Q: What is Dex Dump?

👉 Tool used to analyze Dalvik Executable (DEX) bytecode.

Important Commands
apktool d DivaApplication.apk
xxd DivaApplication.apk | head
dexdump DivaApplication.apk | less
